From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:33:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD Vim visual selection copy for both terminal panes

Terminal command mode supports character, line, and block selections over the focused pane with Vim-style movement. Copy actions collect the selected text from the UI state and the terminal adapter emits an OSC 52 clipboard write so copied transcript or control-list text reaches the real terminal clipboard.
